# SPA fallback + API exclusions. Order matters: first match wins.
# Keep this file plain ASCII and short - see docs/handoff/DEPLOY_NOTES_redirects.md
# for the full reasoning (why /graphql returns 404 instead of proxying).
/graphql/*   /404.html   404
/graphql     /404.html   404
/api/*       /404.html   404
/*           /index.html 200
